ename\":\"μShare_ Non-Intrusive Kernel Co-Locating on NVIDIA GPUs\",\"score\":2141.1804370865425,\"foundWords\":[\"serving\",\"serving场景比较μshare\",\"serving框架如何使用\",\"serving系统，通过在linux\",\"serving系统\",\"inference\",\"benchmark\",\"latency\",\"throughput\",\"gpu\",\"gpu可移植性。额外对比tacker\",\"gpu可移植性\",\"gpu（84\",\"gpu（108\",\"gpu）\",\"gpus\",\"experiment\",\"experiment_notes/系统实验笔记\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"GPUs\",\"offset\":54},{\"match\":\"Serving\",\"offset\":64},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":105},{\"match\":\"inference\",\"offset\":128},{\"match\":\"serving系统，通过在Linux\",\"offset\":138},{\"match\":\"Serving\",\"offset\":237},{\"match\":\"serving场景比较μShare\",\"offset\":1026},{\"match\":\"throughput\",\"offset\":1097},{\"match\":\"throughput\",\"offset\":1125},{\"match\":\"latency\",\"offset\":1202},{\"match\":\"GPU可移植性。额外对比Tacker\",\"offset\":1285},{\"match\":\"throughput\",\"offset\":1508},{\"match\":\"benchmark\",\"offset\":1570},{\"match\":\"inference\",\"offset\":1583},{\"match\":\"GPU（84\",\"offset\":1719},{\"match\":\"GPU（108\",\"offset\":1834},{\"match\":\"Inference\",\"offset\":1929},{\"match\":\"Serving\",\"offset\":1970},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":2009},{\"match\":\"Serving框架如何使用\",\"offset\":2773},{\"match\":\"serving\",\"offset\":2856},{\"match\":\"GPU）\",\"offset\":3251},{\"match\":\"throughput\",\"offset\":4053},{\"match\":\"throughput\",\"offset\":4321}],\"excerpt\":\"## μShare: Non-Intrusive Kernel Co-Locating on NVIDIA GPUs\\n- 属于Serving调度的实现是什么？实验比较什么？\\n  提出μShare，一个非侵入式GPU kernel co-location inference serving系统，通过在Linux userspace拦截kernel launch并动态调整blocksize，实现不同kernel在同一SM内的scattered co-location。核心Serving调度实现包含：(1) Kernel Interceptor：通过LD_PRELOAD劫持CUDA kernel launch函数（cudaLaunchKernel、cuBLAS/cuDNN封装函数），使用dlopen+d…\"},{\"filename\":\"experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/IFMoE_ An Inference Framework Design for Fine-grained MoE.md\",\"basename\":\"IFMoE_ An Inference Framework Design for Fine-grained MoE\",\"score\":2056.3154750289254,\"foundWords\":[\"se