{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_02_9WZ85y3CI723Bi0DCuVg5458","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/A Survey of Resource-efficient LLM and Multimodal Foundation Models.md\",\"basename\":\"A Survey of Resource-efficient LLM and Multimodal Foundation Models\",\"score\":236.32175497355593,\"foundWords\":[\"tensorrt\",\"tensorrt-llm\",\"llm\",\"llmaas范式\",\"llmaa\",\"llmcad的speculative\",\"llm为例说明serving框架输入到硬件执行的全过程\",\"llm的paged\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":34},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":142},{\"match\":\"LLM的Paged\",\"offset\":464},{\"match\":\"LLMCad的speculative\",\"offset\":873},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":970},{\"match\":\"llm\",\"offset\":1004},{\"match\":\"LLMaaS范式\",\"offset\":1029},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":1232},{\"match\":\"TensorRT-LLM\",\"offset\":1431},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":1676},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":1713},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":1768},{\"match\":\"llm\",\"offset\":1814},{\"match\":\"llm\",\"offset\":1861},{\"match\":\"LLM为例说明Serving框架输入到硬件执行的全过程\",\"offset\":2049},{\"match\":\"LLM的Paged\",\"offset\":2083}],\"excerpt\":\"## A Survey of Resource-efficient LLM and Multimodal Foundation Models\\n- 属于Serving调度的实现是什么？实验比较什么？\\n  本文为综述论文，无原创Serving系统实验。§5.3-5.4系统梳理云侧与端侧LLM serving系统的优化技术：\\n  (i) **推理加速**（§5.3.1）——Kernel优化（FlashAttention/FlashAttention-2加速prefill、Flash-Decoding/FastGen加速decode）、Parallelism策略（TP+PP+DP+Expert Parallelism混合）、Request Batching与调度（O…\"},{\"filename\":\"experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/Shift Parallelism_ Low-Latency, High-Throughput LLM Inference for Dynamic Workloads.md\",\"basename\":\"Shift Parallelism_ Low-Latency, High-Throughput LLM Inference for Dynamic Workloads\",\"score\":216.12880337467226,\"foundWords\":[\"tensorrt\",\"tensorrt-llm\",\"llm\",\"llm插件实现\",\"llm插件系统\",\"llm部署中按batch\",\"llm内置tp和dp\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":51},{\"match\":\"LLM部署中按batch\",\"offset\":226},{\"match\":\"LLM内置TP和DP\",\"offset\":987},{\"match\":\"TensorRT-LLM\",\"offset\":1049},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":1275},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":1306},{\"match\":\"LLM插件系统\",\"offset\":1906},{\"match\":\"LLM插件实现\",\"offset\":2082},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":2147},{\"match\":\"llm\",\"offset\":2173},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":2344},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":2895},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":2947}],\"excerpt\":\"## Shift Parallelism: Low-Latency, High-Throughput LLM Inference for Dynamic Workloads\\n- 属于Serving调度的实现是什么？实验比较什么？\\n  提出Shift Parallelism，将训练用Ulysses Sequence Parallelism (SP) 改造为inference可用的并行方式，并与Tensor Parallelism (TP) 在同一vLLM部署中按batch token数阈值动态切换。核心实现：(1) SP for Inference：为SP添加GQA支持（通过all-to-all中KV cache replication处理Q head数与KV head数不匹配的场景）、sma…\"},{\"filename\":\"experiment_notes/算法实验笔记/Fast-dLLM_ Training-free Acceleration of Diffusion LLM by Enabling KV Cache and Parallel Decoding.md\",\"basename\":\"Fast-dLLM_ Training-free Acceleration of Diffusion LLM by Enabling KV Cache and Parallel Decoding\",\"score\":206.80244789089153,\"foundWords\":[\"tensorrt\",\"tensorrt-llm\",\"llm\",\"llm的双向注意力特性，设计分块生成的近似kv\",\"llm的双向注意力特性\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":9},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":54},{\"match\":\"LLM的双向注意力特性，设计分块生成的近似KV\",\"offset\":196},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":614},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":1168},{\"match\":\"TensorRT-LLM\",\"offset\":1172},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":1647}],\"excerpt\":\"## Fast-dLLM: Training-free Acceleration of Diffusion LLM by Enabling KV Cache and Parallel Decoding\\n- 属于算法pipeline的实现是什么？实验比较什么？\\n  实现两个核心算法组件：(1) **Block-wise Approximate KV Cache**：针对Diffusion LLM的双向注意力特性，设计分块生成的近似KV Cache机制（PrefixCache和DualCache），利用相邻推理步之间KV激活的高余弦相似度（≈1），在块内复用缓存的Key和Value，块完成后统一更新所有token…\"},{\"filename\":\"experiment_notes/算法实验笔记/LiquidGEMM_ Hardware-Efficient W4A8 GEMM Kernel for High-Performance LLM Serving.md\",\"basename\":\"LiquidGEMM_ Hardware-Efficient W4A8 GEMM Kernel for High-Performance LLM Serving\",\"score\":200.94483561906483,\"foundWords\":[\"tensorrt\",\"tensorrt-llm\",\"tensorrt-llm开源\",\"llm\",\"llm开源\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":72},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":1011},{\"match\":\"TensorRT-LLM开源\",\"offset\":1102},{\"match\":\"TensorRT-LLM\",\"offset\":1143}],\"excerpt\":\"## LiquidGEMM: Hardware-Efficient W4A8 GEMM Kernel for High-Performance LLM Serving\\n- 属于算法pipeline的实现是什么？实验比较什么？\\n  实现是LiquidQuant (LQQ)，一种硬件高效的两级W4A8量化算法。LQQ通过rotation-based transformation将INT8值映射到UINT8域再量化为UINT4，配合two's complement特性设计dequantization，仅需两条32-bit硬件指令（IMAD + XOR）处理四个元素，避免溢出。离线量化流程：FP16 → 第一级per-channel量化到INT8（限制在[-119, 119]范围）→ 第二级shift到UINT8域 → per-group量…\"},{\"filename\":\"experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/LiquidGEMM_ Hardware-Efficient W4A8 GEMM Kernel for High-Performance LLM Serving.md\",\"basename\":\"LiquidGEMM_ Hardware-Efficient W4A8 GEMM Kernel for High-Performance LLM Serving\",\"score\":178.47167768878793,\"foundWords\":[\"tensorrt\",\"tensorrt-llm\",\"llm\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":72},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":166},{\"match\":\"TensorRT-LLM\",\"offset\":453},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":1557},{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":1624}],\"excerpt\":\"## LiquidGEMM: Hardware-Efficient W4A8 GEMM Kernel for High-Performance LLM Serving\\n- 属于Serving调度的实现是什么？实验比较什么？\\n  实现是LiquidServe——基于LiquidGEMM W4A8 GEMM kernel构建的端到端LLM serving系统。LiquidServe集成了：(1) FlashAttention-2用于runtime attention计算；(2) PagedAttention用于KV cache管理；(3) SmoothQuant per-token动态激活量化（FP16→INT8）；(4) KV cache per-channel静态INT8量化（scale factor离线计算）；(5) 权重离线两级…\"},{\"filename\":\"experiment_notes/系统实验笔记/D2MoE_ Dual Routing and Dynamic Scheduling for Efficient On-Device MoE-based LLM Serving.md\",\"basename\":\"D2MoE_ Dual Routing and Dynamic Scheduling for Efficient On-Device MoE-based LLM Serving\",\"score\":160.48774060549786,\"foundWords\":[\"tensorrt\",\"llm\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"LLM\",\"offset\":80},{\"match\":\"LLM\"