ble\n- Have proper Chinese annotations\n- Use L2 granularity (framework simulation examples)\n- Each method needs: 笔记证据 + 方法细节 + 实验环境\n- Annotate vault paths and omnisearch scores\n\nLet me organize this into:\n1. 笔记证据概览 (overview table)\n2. 实验基准数据集与评估指标 (primary - detailed)\n3. 硬件平台实验环境详解 (primary - detailed)\n4. 跨硬件平台对比实验 (primary - detailed)\n5. Serving框架实验实现 (secondary - auxiliary)\n6. 方法对比表\n7. 不确定性\n\nI'll write the answer now.","signature":"4ab95842-194d-47b6-8add-8a3ba1f60167"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":79652,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"93bcbd24-6351-41e1-b068-2707411d4889","uuid":"39fdd7ba-2d9f-42a4-8343-ab72c7032538"}
